<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>All types and figures of the ancient time,</l><l>All things we ever need, both great and small,</l><l>Only are shadows of the Christ of God,</l><l>Showing that He must be our all in all.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>All things are vanity of vanities,</l><l>Christ, the reality all things to fill;</l><l>Though everything we may enjoy and own,</l><l>If we’re devoid of Christ we’re empty still.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Christ is our real God, our real Lord,</l><l>Christ is our real life, our real light;</l><l>Christ is our real food, our real drink,</l><l>Our real clothing, and our real might.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Christ also is the one reality</l><l>Of all our doctrine and theology;</l><l>And all our scriptural knowledge without Him</l><l>Is just in letter and is vanity.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Christ, the reality of time and space,</l><l>Christ, the reality of every stage;</l><l>Christ is the one reality of all</l><l>Thru all eternity from age to age.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
